        "quote": "(a) As provided by K.S.A. 12-505 , if the City Council determines that the petition should be granted, the City Council shall order by appropriate ordinance that such vacation be made. Said order may include the reservation to the City and the owners of any lesser property rights for public utilities, rights-of-way and easements for public service facilities.",
