        },
        "quote": "(c) Upon adoption and publication of any vacation order by ordinance, the City Clerk shall certify a copy of such order to the Register of Deeds for recording.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.60.020:block:2#text",
