          "start": 761
        },
        "quote": "(d) When any street or alley is vacated it shall revert to the owners of land adjoining on each side in the proportion in which it was originally dedicated or taken, except in cases where such street or alley may have been dedicated or taken for public use in a different proportion, in which case it shall revert to the adjoining land in the same proportion as it was dedicated or taken. (Code 1981 § 40-223. Code 1995 § 130-477.)",
